# The worksheet PDFs in private-pdfs/ are intentionally excluded from the
# public static deployment. They are kept here only as the source-of-truth
# reference copies for editing — api/download.js does NOT read from this
# directory at runtime. It serves base64-embedded copies from
# api/_pdf-data.js instead, since a plain require() of a sibling module is
# reliably bundled by Vercel, unlike an external file read at runtime (which
# is what this exclusion was originally meant to support, and which did not
# work reliably across two attempts).
#
# Do not remove this line, and do not re-add these files to the repo root —
# doing either makes every worksheet downloadable with no email required.
private-pdfs/
